1
00:00:04,000 --> 00:00:06,960
Shiver, my right hand...

2
00:00:08,250 --> 00:00:11,210
By the contract we made, I order you

3
00:00:13,050 --> 00:00:17,630
to wreathe yourself in black flame and grant my desire!

4
00:00:22,530 --> 00:00:24,850
Now I can't heat up my kara-age!

5
00:00:24,850 --> 00:00:26,100
You sure about this?

6
00:00:25,430 --> 00:00:29,730
Mayuri, this is no longer a microwave. It's a time machine!

7
00:00:26,100 --> 00:00:28,730
If you join the lab, you'll be dealing with this all day.

8
00:00:29,960 --> 00:00:31,520
That's not fair!

9
00:00:31,520 --> 00:00:35,150
Then go buy me a new microwave, Okarin.

10
00:00:35,150 --> 00:00:36,990
I don't have the money.

11
00:00:38,000 --> 00:00:40,320
I told you not to photograph me.

12
00:00:41,030 --> 00:00:41,990
It's to celebrate.

13
00:00:42,410 --> 00:00:43,620
Anyway, no photos!

14
00:00:45,240 --> 00:00:48,000
Okay, done programming.

15
00:00:48,000 --> 00:00:52,080
Phone Microwave, 2nd Ed., Version 1.03 is done.

16
00:00:52,080 --> 00:00:54,590
Now you can use the Phone Microwave's cell phone

17
00:00:54,590 --> 00:00:56,510
to send a D-mail to any phone you like!

18
00:00:56,510 --> 00:00:58,090
You did it, Daru!

19
00:00:58,470 --> 00:01:00,640
Then let's continue our experiments.

20
00:01:01,080 --> 00:01:03,180
Is it really a time machine?

21
00:01:03,640 --> 00:01:05,390
Don't tell anyone, okay?

22
00:01:06,470 --> 00:01:09,890
But don't you think the landlord will get mad at us?

23
00:01:11,190 --> 00:01:12,810
Part-time warrior!

24
00:01:14,610 --> 00:01:16,320
Mayuri, be quiet!

25
00:01:16,900 --> 00:01:18,150
Where's Mr. Braun?

26
00:01:18,150 --> 00:01:18,780
Who's that?

27
00:01:18,780 --> 00:01:21,240
Don't call my dad Mr. Braun...

28
00:01:21,240 --> 00:01:23,120
You mean the boss? He's out on a call.

29
00:01:23,120 --> 00:01:24,490
I don't think he'll be back for a while.

30
00:01:24,490 --> 00:01:25,200
Is that true?!

31
00:01:25,200 --> 00:01:26,950
If it weren't, I couldn't screw around outside.

32
00:01:34,000 --> 00:01:34,880
Mayuri.

33
00:01:35,290 --> 00:01:36,050
Okay.

34
00:01:49,100 --> 00:01:50,520
Mayuri

35
00:01:49,100 --> 00:01:50,520
( None )

36
00:01:49,100 --> 00:01:49,730
Tutturu

37
00:01:49,730 --> 00:01:50,520
Mayushii

38
00:01:52,230 --> 00:01:53,060
This is...

39
00:01:54,980 --> 00:01:55,860
I saw a light.

40
00:02:10,320 --> 00:02:15,990
Even the number of several billion heartbeats

