424
00:03:26,990 --> 00:03:31,990
Divergence

425
00:03:26,990 --> 00:03:31,990
Singularity

426
00:03:35,370 --> 00:03:39,460
Juicy Kara-age #1 would taste better...

427
00:03:41,130 --> 00:03:43,090
Hey, there's no Dr Pepper!

428
00:03:43,090 --> 00:03:44,380
They were out.

429
00:03:44,380 --> 00:03:46,880
If they're out, keep looking until you find some!

430
00:03:46,880 --> 00:03:49,970
That's what it means to be a Dr Pepperian.

431
00:03:49,970 --> 00:03:51,180
They didn't have any.

432
00:03:51,180 --> 00:03:52,930
What do you want me to do about it?

433
00:03:53,310 --> 00:03:53,930
You want some or not?

434
00:03:57,610 --> 00:03:58,440
Jeez...

435
00:03:58,850 --> 00:04:03,110
What kind of mad scientist worries about not getting enough vegetables?

436
00:04:06,360 --> 00:04:07,950
Let's begin the Round Table.

437
00:04:08,200 --> 00:04:10,820
It's hot in here. Let's open a window.

438
00:04:10,820 --> 00:04:12,950
What are you doing, Daru?

439
00:04:12,950 --> 00:04:15,500
What if the Organization discovers our secret...

440
00:04:15,500 --> 00:04:17,040
Delusion fail!

441
00:04:18,670 --> 00:04:19,630
What's a Round Table?

442
00:04:22,590 --> 00:04:25,840
We will now move Operation Urd to stage 2,

443
00:04:26,290 --> 00:04:28,840
and run experiments to make the D-mail

444
00:04:28,840 --> 00:04:30,390
more practical.

445
00:04:30,710 --> 00:04:32,850
During summer, you need barley tea.

446
00:04:32,850 --> 00:04:34,020
Want some, too, Moeka-san?

447
00:04:34,350 --> 00:04:36,600
Practical? What are we going to do?

448
00:04:38,520 --> 00:04:40,150
Change the past.

449
00:04:43,610 --> 00:04:45,990
Wait... That's too dangerous.

450
00:04:45,990 --> 00:04:47,990
If you create a time paradox...

451
00:04:47,990 --> 00:04:50,700
Assistant, as a scientist,

452
00:04:50,700 --> 00:04:54,910
aren't you interested in whether we can alter the past, using the D-Mail?

453
00:04:54,910 --> 00:04:56,330
W-Well...

454
00:04:56,330 --> 00:04:58,210
But what will we change?

455
00:04:58,210 --> 00:04:59,250
Good question.

456
00:04:59,830 --> 00:05:03,710
Here's what I want to accomplish with this operation...

457
00:05:06,670 --> 00:05:08,590
Win the lottery.

458
00:05:11,510 --> 00:05:14,100
Okarin... Mayushii is very sad.

459
00:05:14,260 --> 00:05:15,560
I'm in.

