00:05:15,560 --> 00:05:17,640
If I had money, I could buy new parts for the computer,

461
00:05:17,640 --> 00:05:19,890
and I could go to May Queen all I want.

462
00:05:18,560 --> 00:05:23,690
We should work toward world peace.

463
00:05:23,690 --> 00:05:28,570
Like give everyone in the world an Upa cushion...

464
00:05:26,150 --> 00:05:28,570
Okabe, that's really lame.

465
00:05:29,740 --> 00:05:32,160
It's an experiment to see if we can change the past.

466
00:05:32,160 --> 00:05:34,160
That would be the easiest way to tell!

467
00:05:34,160 --> 00:05:35,620
But basically, you just want money, right?

468
00:05:35,620 --> 00:05:37,790
Shut up, Celeb 17!

469
00:05:37,790 --> 00:05:39,500
Cele... Huh?

470
00:05:39,790 --> 00:05:41,420
Celeb 17!

471
00:05:42,580 --> 00:05:45,380
I don't want to hear anything from a woman

472
00:05:45,380 --> 00:05:47,210
living in a hotel on her parent's money!

473
00:05:47,210 --> 00:05:49,300
I'm eighteen.

474
00:05:49,300 --> 00:05:52,510
But there are all kinds of lottery tickets.

475
00:05:52,510 --> 00:05:53,640
Which one do you want?

476
00:05:53,640 --> 00:05:54,890
Well...

477
00:05:56,760 --> 00:05:58,100
What's wrong?

478
00:05:58,100 --> 00:05:58,970
No...

479
00:06:01,310 --> 00:06:02,810
Where'd Moeka go?

480
00:06:03,180 --> 00:06:03,650
Huh?

481
00:06:06,270 --> 00:06:07,730
Wait!

482
00:06:09,810 --> 00:06:11,740
Sheesh... Can't take my eyes off you for a second.

483
00:06:12,110 --> 00:06:13,950
Because you didn't respond.

484
00:06:14,700 --> 00:06:16,780
I really want to borrow the IBN 5100. 
Please... 
It's okay, right?

485
00:06:17,950 --> 00:06:20,750
Is she supposed to be a valley girl LOL?

486
00:06:21,080 --> 00:06:23,870
Christina, keep a close eye on her,

487
00:06:23,870 --> 00:06:25,710
