488
00:06:26,120 --> 00:06:28,130
How am I supposed to do that?

489
00:06:28,960 --> 00:06:31,090
Do you want to see the lab, Moeka-san?

490
00:06:31,720 --> 00:06:33,800
I'll show you around later.

491
00:06:33,800 --> 00:06:35,720
Mayushii is good at that!

492
00:06:36,370 --> 00:06:38,260
I did it for Kurisu-chan, too!

493
00:06:39,520 --> 00:06:42,270
Where should I start?

494
00:06:43,190 --> 00:06:44,600
I see.

495
00:06:44,600 --> 00:06:46,110
The Loto 6.

496
00:06:47,940 --> 00:06:51,190
Every Thursday, the winning numbers are announced.

497
00:06:51,190 --> 00:06:52,610
We'll send the numbers to the past.

498
00:06:53,240 --> 00:06:54,490
We're really doing this?

499
00:06:54,490 --> 00:06:56,450
You have any other ideas?

500
00:06:57,120 --> 00:06:59,620
Which number do you want?

501
00:07:00,040 --> 00:07:01,700
By the way, first prize is...

502
00:07:03,040 --> 00:07:04,370
200,000,000 yen!

503
00:07:05,120 --> 00:07:06,330
200,000,000 yen?

504
00:07:06,330 --> 00:07:07,210
Wait, Daru.

505
00:07:07,750 --> 00:07:09,380
200,000,000 yen is a bit much.

506
00:07:10,170 --> 00:07:12,300
First prize would draw too much attention.

507
00:07:12,970 --> 00:07:14,970
The Organization is chasing me, after all.

508
00:07:14,970 --> 00:07:16,010
You got cold feet, didn't you?

509
00:07:16,260 --> 00:07:17,340
What's second prize?

510
00:07:18,680 --> 00:07:20,060
23,000,000 yen.

511
00:07:20,060 --> 00:07:20,810
Third?

512
00:07:21,520 --> 00:07:22,520
700,000.

513
00:07:22,520 --> 00:07:24,640
We'll go with that!

514
00:07:24,890 --> 00:07:26,690
Okabe's chicken, isn't he?

515
00:07:26,690 --> 00:07:29,900
That's coming from someone worried about a time paradox, Cel-7?

516
00:07:27,940 --> 00:07:29,900
And this is the Upa cushion!

517
00:07:30,320 --> 00:07:32,780
When you're tired or feeling down,

518
00:07:32,780 --> 00:07:34,450
