Hey!

523
00:07:51,340 --> 00:07:52,590
Shining Finger!

524
00:07:53,710 --> 00:07:56,800
Here's your first Lab Member mission.

525
00:07:57,550 --> 00:07:59,350
Ooh, your first job!

526
00:07:59,820 --> 00:08:02,260
Think of what to write in the D-mail.

527
00:08:02,810 --> 00:08:05,520
Something that will make the me of

