531
00:08:14,440 --> 00:08:17,150
I guess that's it.

532
00:08:15,280 --> 00:08:17,150
Buy Lotto-6 
You'll win!

533
00:08:17,480 --> 00:08:19,240
Okay, we're ready.

534
00:08:20,120 --> 00:08:22,620
At last, the time has come to open Steins Gate!

535
