00:15:48,730 --> 00:15:51,440
<i>It never happened.</i>

747
00:15:53,280 --> 00:15:56,990
<i>So why do I remember?</i>

748
00:16:02,740 --> 00:16:04,120
Oh, no!

749
00:16:04,120 --> 00:16:08,040
Nae, whatever he asks, don't tell him I was slacking off!

750
00:16:08,420 --> 00:16:10,460
Will you give me a ride on your bike?

751
00:16:10,460 --> 00:16:11,710
I will!

752
00:16:13,630 --> 00:16:14,920
Okabe Rintarou!

753
00:16:16,050 --> 00:16:17,880
I'm on your side, okay?

754
00:16:21,930 --> 00:16:22,640
You!

755
00:16:24,060 --> 00:16:25,430
Daddy!

756
00:16:25,430 --> 00:16:26,230
Okabe!

757
00:16:26,640 --> 00:16:28,730
What were you doing with my daughter?!

758
00:16:29,060 --> 00:16:30,940
W-Wait! I wasn't doing anything!

759
00:16:30,940 --> 00:16:32,020
Shut up!

760
00:16:32,020 --> 00:16:37,360
A guy like you couldn't control himself if left alone with my daughter!

761
00:16:37,360 --> 00:16:39,410
Do you always think about me like that?

762
00:16:39,410 --> 00:16:41,830
And we weren't alone...

763
00:16:41,830 --> 00:16:43,700
Suzuha was just here.

764
00:16:43,700 --> 00:16:46,120
What? Is that true, Nae?

765
00:16:46,540 --> 00:16:49,580
I promised, so I can't say she was slacking off.

766
00:16:49,580 --> 00:16:50,630
What?

767
00:16:51,170 --> 00:16:52,920
Hey! Part-timer!

768
00:16:54,460 --> 00:16:56,590
You were slacking off!

769
00:16:56,590 --> 00:16:59,590
The 42-inch was left on!

770
00:16:59,910 --> 00:17:03,260
I-I'm sorry!

771
00:17:11,440 --> 00:17:13,230
I'll talk about the reason why later.

772
00:17:13,860 --> 00:17:15,440
We're stopping the experiment for today.

773
00:17:15,900 --> 00:17:17,740
We're done for the day.

774
00:17:20,660 --> 00:17:22,410
Okarin...

775
00:17:28,080 --> 00:17:31,890
So, assistant, you're not going home?

776
00:17:32,290 --> 00:17:33,790
I'm thinking.

777
00:17:34,540 --> 00:17:35,750
I see.

778
00:17:35,750 --> 00:17:38,090
You'd be all alone if you went back to the hotel,

779
00:17:38,090 --> 00:17:39,970
so you want me to spend time with you.

780
00:17:39,970 --> 00:17:41,470
Right, little Cel-7?

781
00:17:41,470 --> 00:17:43,180
Don't call me Cel-7!

782
00:17:43,760 --> 00:17:46,140
I've gotta send this text message.

783
00:17:46,140 --> 00:17:51,440
If you want to stay here, be quiet, The Zombie.

784
00:17:53,270 --> 00:17:55,940
That's the name that bugs me most.

785
00:18:08,500 --> 00:18:12,170
You're like a girl, waiting for a message from her crush.

786
00:18:12,960 --> 00:18:15,500
You really want attention that much?

787
00:18:18,210 --> 00:18:19,970
Who was that message to?

788
00:18:21,930 --> 00:18:23,140
John Titor.

789
00:18:27,560 --> 00:18:30,030
Rukako

790
00:18:27,560 --> 00:18:30,030
The Lottery

791
00:18:27,560 --> 00:18:30,030
I'm really sorry

792
00:18:34,900 --> 00:18:37,110
I Had Fun

793
00:18:34,900 --> 00:18:37,110
Next time, tell me about 
the time machine. 
It's a promise. 
A promise, right? 
Bye! 
Moeka

